### 10. **No Error Handling (OWASP A09:2021 - Security Logging and Monitoring Failures)**
**Severity: MEDIUM**

**Issue:** No try-catch blocks or global error handler. Stack traces could expose sensitive information in errors.

**Recommendation:**
```javascript
const express = require('express');
const app = express();

// Add try-catch in async routes
app.get('/users', async (req, res, next) => {
  try {
    // Your logic here
    res.json([]);
  } catch (error) {
    next(error); // Pass to error handler
  }
});

// Global error handler (must be last)
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
