207	### 5. **No Rate Limiting (OWASP A01: Broken Access Control / DoS)**
208	
209	**Issue:** Endpoints can be abused with unlimited requests.
210	
211	**Risk Level:** HIGH
212	- Vulnerability to brute force attacks
213	- Vulnerability to Denial of Service (DoS)
214	- No protection against scraping
215	
216	**Recommended Fix:**
217	```javascript
218	const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');
219	
220	const limiter = rateLimit({
221	  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000, // 15 minutes
222	  max: 100, // limit each IP to 100 requests per windowMs
223	  message: 'Too many requests from this IP, please try again later.',
224	  standardHeaders: true,
225	  legacyHeaders: false,
226	});
227	
228	const strictLimiter = rateLimit({
229	  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,
230	  max: 5, // Stricter limit for sensitive endpoints
231	  skipSuccessfulRequests: true,
232	});
233	
234	app.use('/users', limiter);
235	app.use('/health', limiter);
236	```
