| HIGH | No Input Validation | Add express-validator | Medium |
| HIGH | No Rate Limiting | Add express-rate-limit | Low |
| HIGH | Missing Security Headers | Add helmet.js | Low |
| MEDIUM | No Error Handling | Add error middleware | Medium |
