---

## Implementation Priority

### Phase 1 (Immediate - Week 1)
1. Add HTTPS/TLS enforcement
2. Implement authentication middleware
3. Add Helmet security headers
4. Implement rate limiting

### Phase 2 (Short-term - Week 2)
