286	### 7. **A07: Identification & Authentication Failures** ⚠️ CRITICAL
287	
288	**Issue:** No user identification system
289	- No login mechanism
290	- No session management
291	- No cookie security settings
292	- No CSRF protection
293	
294	**Risk:** Session hijacking, CSRF attacks
295	
296	**Recommendation:**
297	```javascript
298	const cookieParser = require('cookie-parser');
299	const csrf = require('csurf');
300	const session = require('express-session');
301	
302	// Setup session management
303	app.use(cookieParser());
304	app.use(session({
305	  secret: process.env.SESSION_SECRET,
306	  resave: false,
307	  saveUninitialized: true,
308	  cookie: {
309	    secure: true, // Only send over HTTPS
310	    httpOnly: true, // Prevent JavaScript access
311	    maxAge: 3600000, // 1 hour
312	    sameSite: 'strict' // CSRF protection
313	  }
314	}));
315	
316	// CSRF protection middleware
317	const csrfProtection = csrf({ cookie: false });
318	
319	// Apply CSRF protection to state-changing requests
320	app.post('/users', csrfProtection, authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
321	  // Handle user creation
322	  res.json({ message: 'User created' });
323	});
