328	### 8. **A08: Software & Data Integrity Failures** ⚠️ MEDIUM
329	
330	**Issue:** No integrity verification
331	- No request signature verification
332	- No integrity checks on responses
333	- Potential for man-in-the-middle attacks
334	
335	**Risk:** Data tampering, malicious modifications
336	
337	**Recommendation:**
338	```javascript
339	const crypto = require('crypto');
340	
341	// Add request signature verification for sensitive operations
342	const verifyRequestSignature = (req, res, next) => {
343	  const signature = req.headers['x-signature'];
344	  const payload = JSON.stringify(req.body);
345	  
346	  const expectedSignature = crypto
347	    .createHmac('sha256', process.env.REQUEST_SECRET)
348	    .update(payload)
349	    .digest('hex');
350	
351	  if (!crypto.timingSafeEqual(signature, expectedSignature)) {
352	    return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid signature' });
353	  }
354	  next();
355	};
356	
357	app.post('/sensitive-operation', verifyRequestSignature, (req, res) => {
358	  // Handle sensitive operation
359	  res.json({ message: 'Operation completed' });
360	});
361	```
