426	### 10. **A10: Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)** ⚠️ MEDIUM
427	
428	**Issue:** Potential for SSRF if external URLs are fetched
429	- No URL validation for external requests
430	- No allowlist for permitted domains
431	
432	**Risk:** Unauthorized internal access, data exfiltration
433	
434	**Recommendation:**
435	```javascript
436	const axios = require('axios');
437	const url = require('url');
438	
439	// Whitelist of allowed domains
440	const ALLOWED_DOMAINS = ['api.trusted-service.com', 'data.example.com'];
441	
442	// Safe external request function
443	const makeExternalRequest = async (targetUrl) => {
444	  try {
445	    const parsed = url.parse(targetUrl);
446	    
447	    // Validate URL
448	    if (!parsed.hostname) {
449	      throw new Error('Invalid URL');
450	    }
451	
452	    // Check against whitelist
453	    if (!ALLOWED_DOMAINS.includes(parsed.hostname)) {
454	      throw new Error('Domain not allowed');
455	    }
456	
457	    // Prevent internal IP access
458	    const internalIPs = ['127.0.0.1', 'localhost', '::1'];
459	    if (internalIPs.includes(parsed.hostname) || /^192\.168|^10\.|^172\.1[6-9]\.|^172\.2[0-9]\.|^172\.3[01]\./.test(parsed.hostname)) {
460	      throw new Error('Internal IP access not allowed');
461	    }
462	
463	    const response = await axios.get(targetUrl, { timeout: 5000 });
464	    return response.data;
465	  } catch (error) {
466	    logger.error({ error: error.message });
467	    throw new Error('Failed to fetch external resource');
468	  }
469	};
470	```
